{
  "center": "alchemy-utils：数据库无关的…",
  "branches": [
    {
      "label": "项目定位",
      "detail": "基于 SQLAlchemy 复刻 sqlite-utils 核心 API，支持多数据库引擎",
      "children": [
        "保留 insert/upsert/insert_all/upsert_all…",
        "含表结构 introspection 能力",
        "以 ~/dev/sqlite-utils 为参考"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "构建方式",
      "detail": "Simon Willison 用 Codex 与 GPT-5.6 Sol Ultra 做研究 spike",
      "children": [
        "一次洗澡时的灵感项目",
        "少量后续提示即达 alpha 可发布状态",
        "用 uv init 起项目，红绿 TDD + pytest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "支持引擎",
      "detail": "测试覆盖 PostgreSQL、SQLite 与 DuckDB",
      "children": [
        "PostgreSQL 测试参考 django-sql-dashboard",
        "DuckDB 可自动建表匹配 CSV 文件"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "实际用法",
      "detail": "uvx 一行命令即可查询或导入数据",
      "children": [
        "uvx --with 'alchemy-utils[postgresql]'…",
        "curl CSV 管道导入 DuckDB 建 trees 表"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "性能优化",
      "detail": "DuckDB 导入旧金山树木数据从近 1 小时降至约 35 秒",
      "children": [
        "由 Codex 完成优化",
        "数据源为 sf-tree-history 的…"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "flow": [
